 heads=['# Prairie Avenue 1904 — complete named-record assessment','',f'Source snapshot `{REV}`. This is an architectural production assessment, not a newly surveyed building census. Every one of the {len(BUILDINGS)} named records is retained below. Attribute decisions and source links are explicit; historical associations are not a verified 1904 occupant roster. See [shared components](ASSET-CATALOG.md), [frontage register](FRONTAGE-REGISTER.md) and [ticket plan](TICKET-PLAN.md).','']
